c('snp-componentes',1701864184593,'snc-snp','<div data-nebli-organizacao="true"><b>Sistema nervoso periférico</b> inclui:<br>{{c1::Nervos::N…}}<br>{{c1::Gânglios::G…}}<br>{{c1::Terminações nervosas::T…}}</div>','Nerves bundle axons,ganglia contain neuronal somata,and endings connect neural signals with receptors or effectors. This classification uses anatomy,rather than the direction of information flow.','divisoes',origin='Histology',organizador=True,manter_focal=True)
c('glia',1479430416710,'microglia','As <b>células não neuronais</b> de sustentação,isolamento e defesa do tecido nervoso constituem a {{c1::glia}}.','Different glial cells perform distinct support functions. Astrocytes regulate the local environment,oligodendrocytes form CNS myelin,and microglia provide resident immune surveillance.','glia')
c('gfap',1479430479241,'astrocito','O <b>filamento intermediário usado como marcador de astrócitos</b> é {{c1::GFAP}}.','Glial fibrillary acidic protein (GFAP) is an intermediate filament protein used to identify astrocytic differentiation. It is a cell marker,rather than the molecule responsible for myelin insulation.','glia','A-step')
